00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.540
According to sociologist, Carolyn Chen,

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:12.060
our obsession with always achieving more

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.040
is symptomatic of a larger phenomenon.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:17.250
First scene on a wide
scale in Silicon Valley.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:19.770
Specifically, Chen argues work is becoming

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:22.980
increasingly central to
